 upon a time she fell in love with a  deviant had kids  gave them away so these kids are going  to be the offspring of an eternal  which is almost essentially a god and a  deviant which is also a very powerful  being  i believe that these kids could be the  start of the x gene  in the mcu just based off of what their  biological structure could be  take thanos for example thanos is  actually an eternal he was born of two  eternal parents but when he was born he  inherited  the deviant gene so he kind of has both  dna  the dna of an eternal and the dna of  deviants and just look how freaking op  thanos came out  one of the strongest beings in the  universe and trust me in the comics he's  a lot more powerful  than he is in the mcu in the actual  infinity saga comics he crushes not only  the avengers but the x-men and the  fantastic four  just a bunch of different heroes all  coming together to fight him he  completely destroys them and he does  have powers of his own  outside of using the infinity gauntlet  so we could if my theory is correct  essentially have  two kids who are like thanos hopefully  not as ugly but two kids who inherit  these two different  insanely powerful genes perhaps the dna  of an eternal  and a deviant combined could give us  that mutant  gene and remember athena is thousands  and thousands and  thousands of years old if she had her  kids during the time of  babylon that means the mutant gene could  have existed for thousands and thousands  of years  and those kids would go on to mate with  other people and have kids which would  spread the mutant gene which would mean  mutants have been around in the mcu  since almost the beginning of time  now that is just my personal theory  you'll have to let me know what you  think about it in the comments down  below but regardless we have  confirmation that the mutants are coming  in phase four one of them coming in less  than a month in black widow  this is the start of the x-men team  eventually comi